ine-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-41\"><strong><span class=\"citation-263 citation-end-263\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Thành phần cấu tạo:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-42\"><strong><span class=\"citation-262 citation-end-262\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Băng:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-261 citation-end-261\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Vải viscose và Polyamide có độ co giãn cao.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-43\"><strong><span class=\"citation-260 citation-end-260\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Gạc:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-259 citation-end-259\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Viscose, có lớp màng trên cùng bằng Polyethylene không gây dính vết thương.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-44\"><strong><span class=\"citation-258 citation-end-258\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Chất dính:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> Keo oxit kẽm không dùng dung môi, an toàn cho da.<sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-45\"><strong><span class=\"citation-257 citation-end-257\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Hạn sử dụng & Bảo quản:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-256 citation-end-256\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Xem trên bao bì sản phẩm (Bảo quản nơi khô ráo, thoáng mát, tránh ánh nắng trực tiếp).<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong>MÔ TẢ SẢN PHẨM</strong></h3><h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong>1. Giới thiệu chung</strong></h4><p data-path-to-node=\"10\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-46\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;\">Băng dán cá nhân <strong>Zilgo khổ to (3.8 x 7.2cm)</strong> là vật dụng y tế thiết yếu không thể thiếu trong tủ thuốc gia đình, văn phòng hay các chuyến du lịch. <span class=\"citation-255 citation-end-255\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Với kích thước lớn hơn các dòng băng cá nhân thông thường, sản phẩm giúp che phủ và bảo vệ tối ưu các vết thương lớn hơn, vết trầy xước sâu hoặc vùng da rộng bị tổn thương.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-47\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-254 citation-end-254\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">2. Đặc điểm và ưu điểm nổi bật<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></h4><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-48\"><strong><span class=\"citation-253 citation-end-253\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Kích thước khổ lớn tiện lợi:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-252 citation-end-252\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bản to 3.8 x 7.2 cm ôm trọn và bảo vệ hiệu quả các vết thương, vết rách da hoặc trầy xước có diện tích lớn mà băng cá nhân nhỏ khó che hết.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"23\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-49\"><strong><span class=\"citation-251 citation-end-251\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Chất liệu vải co giãn xuất sắc:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"24\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> Làm từ vải viscose và polyamide mềm mại, thông thoáng khí, co giãn linh hoạt theo từng chuyển động của cơ thể tại các vùng như khuỷu tay, đầu gối hoặc bắp chân.<sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-50\"><strong><span class=\"citation-250 citation-end-250\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Gạc không dính vết thương:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"25\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-249\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Lớp gạc mềm được phủ màng Polyethylene đặc biệt, </span><strong>không bị dính vào vết máu hay dịch tiết</strong><span class=\"citation-249 citation-end-249\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">, giúp thay băng không đau rát và không làm tổn thương thêm bề mặt da.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"26\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-51\"><strong><span class=\"citation-248 citation-end-248\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Độ bám dính vượt trội:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"27\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-247 citation-end-247\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Keo oxit kẽm chắc chắn, giúp giữ băng cố định lâu dài ngay cả khi vận động nhiều hoặc tiếp xúc nhẹ với nước.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"28\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-52\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-246 citation-end-246\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">3. Hướng dẫn sử dụng và bảo quản<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"29\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></h4><ul data-path-to-node=\"14\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-53\"><strong><span class=\"citation-245 citation-end-245\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Cách sử dụng:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"30\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-54\"><span class=\"citation-244 citation-end-244\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bước 1: Vệ sinh sạch sẽ vết thương và vùng da xung quanh bằng nước muối sinh lý hoặc dung dịch sát trùng, sau đó lau khô nhẹ nhàng.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"31\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-55\"><span class=\"citation-243 citation-end-243\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bước 2: Gỡ bỏ lớp màng bảo vệ và dán trực tiếp băng cá nhân sao cho phần gạc nằm chính giữa vết thương.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"32\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-56\">Bước 3: Miết nhẹ các mép băng để tăng độ bám dính. <span class=\"citation-242 citation-end-242\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Thay băng hàng ngày hoặc khi bị ướt, bẩn.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"33\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-57\"><strong><span class=\"citation-241 citation-end-241\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bảo quản:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"34\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-58\"><span class=\"citation-240 citation-end-240\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Đậy kín hộp sau khi dùng.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"35\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7e6b4d635255dd75-59\"><span class=\"citation-239 citation-end-239\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Để nơi khô ráo, thoáng mát, tránh ánh nắng trực tiếp và xa tầm tay trẻ em.</span></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
